<title>INDIA: Hongkong Bank cuts Indian prime lending rate.</title>
<headline>Hongkong Bank cuts Indian prime lending rate.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hongkong and Shanghai Banking Corporation on Friday said it cut its Indian prime lending rate to 14.5 percent per annum to 16.0 percent effective June 27.  </p>
<p>The bank's decision is in response to initiatives by the Reserve Bank of India (RBI) on Wednesday to lower interest rates, a bank official said.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
